      "x": 1664,
      "y": 14176,
      "width": 420,
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "fill": "$ink_soft",
      "content": "whole card one target → work detail; corner arrow is a decorative duplicate, not separately focusable; accessible name «{title} — {creator}», descriptor read after name; status_chip appears only in explicit auction/status contexts (not on this board); wishlist slot is designed_post_mvp — future boards only; do_not_invent: price, deadline/countdown, bid count, materials/dimensions, like/save, seller rating. Server-owned values: title, creator, uniqueness descriptor, media asset id. Roles: public discovery. card_lift: translate_y -4, e0→e2, media zoom 1.03, tilt ≤1.2deg; 200ms standard easing. pressed: scale 0.98."
