      "width": 420,
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "fill": "$ink_soft",
      "content": "scene is a region labeled by kicker; reading order kicker → title → creator → statement → status → CTA; CTA and whole media → work detail; statement = value_statement fixture (uniqueness ≤ 120 chars); do_not_invent: price, deadline as headline, bid count. Server-owned values: work, listing status, media order. Role variations: creator profile release and home featured. card/media transitions use gallery_advance; plate_tilt settles at -1.5deg desktop; reduced_motion renders final tilt without settle."
    },
